  "prefLabel": "Hedc 405.01 Mission and Purposes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 405.01 Mission and Purposes.\n\n(a) In its written plan, the applicant shall set forth a well-defined statement of the institution’s mission and purposes.\n\n(b) The applicant shall submit the following documents:\n\n(1) A copy of the vote of the board of the institution’s resolution adopting the statement of mission and purposes as submitted;\n\n(2) A certified copy of the bylaws or other governing instrument specifying the procedures for amendment of the statement of purpose; and\n\n(3) A certificate of registration filed with the New Hampshire secretary of state.\n\nSource. #10429, eff 10-5-13 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hedc 400); ss by #13802, eff 11-2-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hedc400.html"
